/// A simple object to allow referencing of objects contained within the Components object, with the
/// ability to override the `value` of a referenced Parameter.
///
/// <https://spec.openapis.org/arazzo/v1.1.0#reusable-object>
module arazzo.Reusable

/// A runtime expression used to reference the desired object, for example `$components.parameters.page`.
reference: String

/// Sets a value of the referenced parameter.
///
/// This is only allowed when `reference` points at a Parameter Object.
value: Any?
